      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.10 (vs ₹2.90 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.10 (down from ₹2.90 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹578.4m (down 1.3% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹65.3m (down 28% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 11% (down from 15% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was primarily driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 17% per year but the company’s share price has remained flat, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
